<title>UK: Rentenbank sets 100 mln Swiss franc 7-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rentenbank sets 100 mln Swiss franc 7-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Del Gottardo Lugano and Von Ernst.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LW RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.75	MATURITY    19.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.40    PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   19.DEC.96</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
